# Create a free Supabase project, then copy its Project URL and publishable anon key.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# Live AI chat is configured server side, not here. Deploy the Supabase Edge
# Function in supabase/functions/ai-chat and set the LLM key as a secret:
#   supabase secrets set LLM_API_KEY=sk-...
# The key stays on the server and is never shipped to the browser. Without it,
# the assistant falls back to the built-in local brain. Do not put an LLM API
# key in a VITE_ variable: Vite bakes VITE_ vars into the public client bundle.

# Bank details customers see when paying an order by transfer (checkout and
# the Orders page). The real account is already set as a default in
# src/media.js (Palmpay / 9061965441 / Bolatito Roqeebah Kehinde);
